### *create user
POST http://localhost:3000/signup HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "user1",
    "email": "user1@example.com",
    "password": "password123",
    "age": 25
}

### *get profile
GET http://localhost:3000/profile HTTP/1.1

### *login user
POST http://localhost:3000/login HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "user1@example.com",
    "password": "password123"
}
